    "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The measure of angle <math alttext=\"upper R\"><mi>R</mi></math> is <math alttext=\"StartFraction 2 pi Over 3 EndFraction\"><mrow>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>&pi;</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mn>3</mn>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow></math> radians. The measure of angle <math alttext=\"upper T\"><mi>T</mi></math> is <math alttext=\"StartFraction 5 pi Over 12 EndFraction\"><mrow>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>5</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>&pi;</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mn>12</mn>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow></math> radians greater than the measure of angle <math alttext=\"upper R\"><mi>R</mi></math>. What is the measure of angle <math alttext=\"upper T\"><mi>T</mi></math>, in <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">degrees</span>?</p>",
    "type": "mcq",
    "correctAnswer": "C",
