        "text": "<p><math alttext=\"negative five sixths pi dot StartFraction 360 degree Over pi EndFraction\"><mrow>\n\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<mn>5</mn>\n\t\t<mn>6</mn>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n<mi>&#960;</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>360</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mfrac></math></p>"
