    "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Points <math alttext=\"upper Q\"><mi>Q</mi></math> and <math alttext=\"upper R\"><mi>R</mi></math> lie on a circle with center <math alttext=\"upper P\"><mi>P</mi></math>. The radius of this circle is <math alttext=\"9\"><mn>9</mn></math> inches. Triangle <math alttext=\"upper P upper Q upper R\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>P</mi>\n\t<mi>Q</mi>\n\t<mi>R</mi>\n</mrow></math> has a perimeter of <math alttext=\"31\"><mn>31</mn></math> inches. What is the length, in inches, of <math alttext=\"line segment upper Q upper R\"><mover><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></math>?</p>",
