        "text": "<p><math alttext=\"left parenthesis x minus 16 right parenthesis squared plus left parenthesis y minus 17 right parenthesis squared equals 49 k\"><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mrow><mn>17</mn></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>49</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></math></p>"
