    "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">What is the value of <math alttext=\"tangent StartFraction 92 pi Over 3 EndFraction\"><mi>tan</mi><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mn>92</mn></mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>?</p>",
    "type": "mcq",
    "correctAnswer": "A",
    "explanation": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is correct. A trigonometric ratio can be found using the unit circle, that is, a circle with radius <math alttext=\"1\"><mn>1</mn></math> unit. If a central angle of a unit circle in the <em>xy</em>-plane centered at the origin has its starting side on the positive <em>x</em>-axis and its terminal side intersects the circle at a point <math alttext=\"left parenthesis x comma y right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, then the value of the tangent of the central angle is equal to the <em>y</em>-coordinate divided by the <em>x</em>-coordinate. There are <math alttext=\"2 pi\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t<mi>&pi;</mi>\n</mrow></math> radians in a circle. Dividing <math alttext=\"StartFraction 92 pi Over 3 EndFraction\"><mrow>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>92</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>&pi;</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mn>3</mn>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow></math> by <math alttext=\"2 pi\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t<mi>&pi;</mi>\n</mrow></math> yields <math alttext=\"StartFraction 92 Over 6 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mn>92</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math>, which is equivalent to <math alttext=\"15 plus two thirds\"><mn>15</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>. It follows that on the unit circle centered at the origin in the <em>xy</em>-plane, the angle <math alttext=\"StartFraction 92 pi Over 3 EndFraction\"><mrow>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>92</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>&pi;</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mn>3</mn>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow></math> is the result of <math alttext=\"15\"><mn>15</mn></math> revolutions from its starting side on the positive <em>x</em>-axis followed by a rotation through <math alttext=\"StartFraction 2 pi Over 3 EndFraction\"><mrow>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>&pi;</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mn>3</mn>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow></math> radians. Therefore, the angles <math alttext=\"StartFraction 92 pi Over 3 EndFraction\"><mrow>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>92</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>&pi;</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mn>3</mn>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow></math> and <math alttext=\"StartFraction 2 pi Over 3 EndFraction\"><mrow>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>&pi;</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mn>3</mn>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow></math> are coterminal angles and <math alttext=\"tangent left parenthesis StartFraction 92 pi Over 3 EndFraction right parenthesis\"><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>92</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math> is equal to <math alttext=\"tangent left parenthesis StartFraction 2 pi Over 3 EndFraction right parenthesis\"><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math>. Since <math alttext=\"StartFraction 2 pi Over 3 EndFraction\"><mrow>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>&pi;</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mn>3</mn>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow></math> is greater than <math alttext=\"StartFraction pi Over 2 EndFraction\"><mrow>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<mi>&pi;</mi>\n\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow></math> and less than <math alttext=\"pi\"><mi>&pi;</mi></math>, it follows that the terminal side of the angle is in quadrant II and forms an angle of <math alttext=\"StartFraction pi Over 3 EndFraction\"><mrow>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<mi>&pi;</mi>\n\t\t<mn>3</mn>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow></math>, or <math alttext=\"60 degree\"><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math>, with the negative <em>x</em>-axis. Therefore, the terminal side of the angle intersects the unit circle at the point <math alttext=\"left parenthesis negative one half comma StartFraction StartRoot 3 EndRoot Over 2 EndFraction right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>. It follows that the value of <math alttext=\"tangent left parenthesis StartFraction 2 pi Over 3 EndFraction right parenthesis\"><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math> is <math alttext=\"StartStartFraction StartFraction StartRoot 3 EndRoot Over 2 EndFraction OverOver negative one half EndEndFraction\"><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mrow><mo>-</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfrac></math>, which is equivalent to <math alttext=\"minus StartRoot 3 EndRoot\"><mrow>\n\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t<msqrt>\n\t\t<mn>3</mn>\n\t</msqrt>\n</mrow></math>. Therefore, the value of <math alttext=\"tangent left parenthesis StartFraction 92 pi Over 3 EndFraction right parenthesis\"><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>92</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math> is <math alttext=\"minus StartRoot 3 EndRoot\"><mrow>\n\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t<msqrt>\n\t\t<mn>3</mn>\n\t</msqrt>\n</mrow></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect. This is the value of <math alttext=\"StartStartFraction 1 OverOver tangent left parenthesis StartFraction 92 pi Over 3 EndFraction right parenthesis EndEndFraction\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>92</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math>, not <math alttext=\"tangent left parenthesis StartFraction 92 pi Over 3 EndFraction right parenthesis\"><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>92</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect. This is the value of <math alttext=\"StartStartFraction 1 OverOver tangent left parenthesis StartFraction pi Over 3 EndFraction right parenthesis EndEndFraction\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math>, not <math alttext=\"tangent left parenthesis StartFraction 92 pi Over 3 EndFraction right parenthesis\"><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>92</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect. This is the value of <math alttext=\"tangent left parenthesis StartFraction pi Over 3 EndFraction right parenthesis\"><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math>, not <math alttext=\"tangent left parenthesis StartFraction 92 pi Over 3 EndFraction right parenthesis\"><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>92</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math>.</p>",
