    "difficulty": "hard",
    "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"x squared plus y squared minus 10 x minus 8 y minus 14 n equals 0\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The given equation represents circle A in the <em>xy</em>-plane, where <math alttext=\"n\"><mi>n</mi></math> is a constant. Point <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 11 comma 8 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mn>11</mn><mn>8</mn></mfenced></math> lies on circle B, which has the same center but twice the diameter as circle A. What is the value of <math alttext=\"n\"><mi>n</mi></math>?</p>",
    "type": "grid-in",
